# Frontend Standards

## Tech Stack
- React 19 (Vite)
- TypeScript (Strict mode)
- Tailwind CSS

## Architecture & Conventions
- Use functional components with arrow functions.
- Keep components modular; place shared UI components in `frontend/src/components/ui/`.
- Prioritize native hooks (`useState`, `useEffect`, `useMemo`) for local state management.
- Always implement clean, responsive layouts using Tailwind CSS.

## Testing Standards
- Use `Vitest` and `React Testing Library`.
- Place tests alongside components using the `.test.tsx` naming convention.

